    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA BEAUTIFUL DETACHED FAMILY HOME IN A PICTURE-PERFECT LOCATION\n\nO'Donnellan and Joyce Auctioneers offer for sale this outstanding four bed detached home in the sought after location of Castlegar, Galway, a truly convenient and quiet setting. \n\nBruckey offers the seclusion of the countryside retreat while still within easy reach of Galway City and all necessary amenities for modern day living. \n\nFalling within the local parish of Castlegar, this location is ideal for any purchaser and offers ease of access to both the East and West sides of Galway.\n\nOriginally constructed in 1988, the property offers approximately 213.4 sq.m over two stories, offering impressive living space & ample bedroom accommodation throughout. \n\nThe home has been extensively renovated in recent years and is presented in excellent turnkey condition, with quality finishes and tasteful décor evident throughout.\n\nThe ground floor features a spacious entrance hall, a main living room with feature fireplace, a wonderful bright conservatory and a large open plan kitchen & dining area. A second family living room, office/study, large utility and guest WC completes the ground floor\n\nUpstairs, the property comprises of a main bathroom, four generous double bedrooms and a storage press. The master bedroom boasts a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite bathroom. \n\nExternally, the home offers a tarmacadam driveway with ample parking for multiple vehicles, along with well-maintained lawns and paved patio areas to the front, side, and rear providing excellent outdoor space for relaxation and entertaining.\n\nThis property offers it all, the main Galway -Tuam Road can have you in any destination within a short time, providing access to McHughs highly rated local pub and restaurant, several shopping centres, retails parks, cafes, hotels and all other necessary amenities. \n\nThe area is well serviced with several excellent National & Secondary Schools and the magnificent ATU College Campus. \n\nAlso in the area are several popular employment hubs, business parks, hospitals & multi-nationals. \n\nOutdoor amenities located nearby include Castlegar GAA Club, Ballyloughane Beach, Renmore parklands, Lough Atalia and Galway City Sailing Club.\n\nThe area is excellently serviced by quality transport links allowing easy access to Galway City Centre, neighbouring suburbs, as well as the M6 & M18 motorways. \n\nHomes in this idyllic location rarely come to the market, making this one of the finest turnkey homes to be available for some time, with the added option of purchasing the property fully furnished for ultimate convenience. \n\nViewing is highly recommended and is guaranteed not to disappoint.\n\nKeep up to-date with NEW PROPERTIES by registering your details on our database \n\nFor Further details please contact our office on 091-564212 \nOFFICE OPENING HOURS - MON TO FRI 9AM TO 5:30PM\n\nProperties can be viewed on our website www.odj.ie \n\nNOTE: These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer. They are for information only and give a general idea of the property. They are not to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract, nor to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact. Whilst every care is taken in their preparation, neither O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars. No person in the employment of O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
